{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲地中海地震中心（EMSC）表示，俄羅斯堪察加半島地區周五（16日）發生7級地震，地震震源深度為140公里。</p><p>中國地震台網則測到周五11時35分，俄羅斯堪察加半島附近發生7.2級左右地震。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:19:37.868370+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:57:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:38.598133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:38.598133+00:00","content_hash":"1a57046b49349e00da6dda06e5df3491e2bb13e96503ecb1e4454f633f074cb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}